1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
This jellyfish ages in reverse.

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,500
Meet Turritopsis dohrnii, the “immortal jellyfish.”

3
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:07,500
It’s smaller than your pinky nail,

4
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:10,500
but when it’s hurt, hungry, or old,

5
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:14,000
it does the impossible: it turns back into a baby.

6
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:16,800
Its adult body melts into a blob,

7
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:19,600
cells change jobs,

8
00:00:19,600 --> 00:00:23,000
and it rebuilds as a tiny polyp—ready to grow up again.

9
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:25,500
It can repeat this reset many times.

10
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:28,800
It’s not unkillable—predators and disease still win—

11
00:00:28,800 --> 00:00:31,200
but it cheats aging.

12
00:00:31,200 --> 00:00:34,000
Should we study it for anti-aging clues?

13
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:36,000
Hit like, subscribe,

14
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:39,000
and tell me: which superpower would you choose?